# Live: double-click an edge to select its loop, as in the familiar tool.
# With no command running, a double-click on the top front edge (just on the
# top face's side) takes the top face's four edges; F starts Fillet with them.
waitfor tsr.feature.extrude
wait 600
wdclick 20 0.4 20
wait 500
shot /tmp/live_edge_loop.png
key f
waitfor panelOk
wait 500
click panelOk
wait 1000
